								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?topic=28.msg179#msg179"><img src="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/Themes/safgrey105/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?topic=28.msg179#msg179">clueless mainstream newspaper finally finds out about the Seattle &quot;gang problem&quot;</a></b>
									<div class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> October 05, 2006, 05:23:41 pm &#187;</div></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
